id=netstats-fix
name=Network Stats Fix for GSI
version=v11
versionCode=11
author=Hirbod-JORFlint
description=Universal fix for broken traffic indicator on Android 14+ GSIs. Multi-layer approach: (1) BPF repair via kver_override + bpfloader restart, (2) Native binder proxy fallback reading /proc/net/dev directly with fixed enter_looper, (3) Comprehensive SELinux policy fixes for all GSI variants. Includes watchdog monitoring for persistent fixes.
